  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Let line parallel to common axis be <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">h</mi><mo>.</mo></math> Then coordinates of <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></math> and <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi></math> are<br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">h</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">h</mi></mrow></mfenced></math> and <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mo>-</mo><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">h</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><mrow><mn>8</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">h</mi></mrow></mfenced></math> respectively.<br />If <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi><mo>&#8801;</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#945;</mi><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#946;</mi></mrow></mfenced></math>, then</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#945;</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">h</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mfrac><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">h</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mn>8</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#946;</mi><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">h</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#945;</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">h</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>1</mn></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">h</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mn>8</mn></mfrac></math><br /><math><mo>&#8756;</mo></math> Locus of <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi></math> is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mn>16</mn></mfrac></math></p>",
